# The translation singleton, as its own module directory.
#
# ⚠ NOT BESIDE syn-arcade.qml. A qmldir makes its directory an explicit QML
# module, and syn-arcade.qml and syn-arcade-big.qml are the files quickshell is
# pointed AT — putting one next to them changes how those files themselves are
# resolved. A subdirectory has no such effect, and it keeps the generated
# catalogs (qml/i18n/*.json) beside the singleton that looks for them, which is
# how I18n.qml finds them at all.
#
# ⚠ TWO WINDOWS, ONE SINGLETON. syn-arcade has a desktop window and a big
# screen one, launched as separate quickshell processes; both import "qml" and
# both get the same catalog, so a word they share is translated once.
singleton I18n 1.0 I18n.qml
